  "description": "All happy families are alike; each unhappy family is unhappy in its own way.\n\nAfter Gyeonu moved into Inseo’s once-happy home, Inseo’s daily life slowly began to unravel into misery. From his own bedroom to his parents’ attention and support—and even his piano—Gyeonu steadily took everything away from him, piece by piece.\n\nYet, there is another reason why Inseo despises Gyeonu:\na chilling, bizarre side to Gye Gyeonu that no one else knows about—one that only Inseo has seen.\n\nThen one day, returning home after work, Inseo witnesses an unexpected sight in his own bedroom... *(Source: Bomtoon, translated)*\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/howtotameadog)",
